    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Qliphothic Diagnostics.</strong> You have developed procedures for poking the worst things in the universe without letting them poke back too hard.</p><ul><li>You have a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Investigation (Mind)</strong> or <strong>Occult (Mind)</strong> checks made to examine <strong>Qliphothic residues, anomalies, or artifacts</strong> safely.</li><li>When you succeed on such a check, you reroll the lowest die on the next defense checks you make against any immediate backlash from that specific phenomenon (trap effects, psychic feedback, etc.), at the GM's discretion.</li></ul>",
